\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Just as I am, Thine own to be,
\par Friend of the young, who lovest me,
\par To consecrate myself to Thee,
\par O Jesus Christ, I come.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. In the glad morning of my day,
\par My life to give, my vows to pay,
\par With no reserve and no delay,
\par With all my heart I come.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. I would live ever in the light,
\par I would work ever for the right,
\par I would serve Thee with all my might,
\par Therefore to Thee I come.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Just as I am, young, strong and free
\par To be the best that I can be
\par For truth, and righteousness, and Thee,
\par Lord of my life, I come.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

